@@ -9221,3 +9221,4 @@ Did NOT modify research-roadmap.yaml or scripts/research_conductor.py. Did NOT p
 - 2026-06-17: PHASE F0 (INFRA safety net; defense-in-depth; fixes BOTH .397 harness bugs) -- (1) add a DEGENERATE_CONTROLS check to scripts/adversarial_verify.py + (2) a reusable aggregate-available-report-gaps capstone helper. BUG 1: .397's in-generation run (exp4293) reported a moat off three bit-identical no-op controls (condition_accuracy {{carnot 0.867, rfg 0.3, unguided 0.3, entrgi 0.3}}); adversarial_verify caught it only via the generic TAUTOLOGY check on the two deltas, NOT via a controls-map check. Add a DEGENERATE_CONTROLS check: flag CRITICAL when >=2 distinct control arms in a condition_accuracy/arms map are bit-identical (the no-op signature) -- the sibling of the .397 DEGENERATE_SEPARATION check. BUG 2: the .397 capstone (exp4301) + hygiene (exp4299) BLOCKED spuriously -- ONE missing artifact (exp4294) hard-blocked the whole aggregation and defaulted ALL booleans to False, zeroing out the CONCLUSIVE cross-generator verdict (audit: docs/research-notes/exp4301-capstone-blocked-spurious-false-2026-06-16.md). Build a reusable aggregate-available-report-gaps helper: aggregate the artifacts that ARE present, report missing ones as per-axis gaps, and NEVER let a missing artifact for one axis zero out a conclusive verdict on another. Deliverable = the patched linter + the helper + passing unit tests. Do NOT modify scripts/research_conductor.py. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: degenerate_controls_and_robust_capstone_guards_added_tests_pass; results/experiment_4308_adversarial_verify_degenerate_controls_and_robust_capstone.json
 - 2026-06-17: PHASE F1 (SOTA-ingestion; mandatory per SOTA-Ingestion Cycle Discipline) -- ingest the SOTA for the .398 bleeding-edge forks (efficiency-parity verifiers / iso-FLOPs head-to-head, in-generation energy-guided diffusion with engaged controls, cross-DOMAIN selector generalization, powered retrieval self-learning) and MAP the strongest 3-5 methods onto the .399 roadmap conditioned on the .398 outcomes (did efficiency-parity harden? did the in-generation moat hold with engaged controls? did cross-domain selection hold?). Use the RELIABLE channel ONLY (scripts/sweep_clusters.py / sweep_semscholar.py + low-concurrency WebSearch/WebFetch) -- /deep-research is BANNED in-loop. Every method MUST carry a real arXiv ID/URL. Update research-studying.md (mark ingested) and emit flagged_for_v399. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: sota_ingestion_v399_mapped; results/experiment_4309_sota_ingestion_v399.json
 - 2026-06-17: PHASE F2 (hygiene; re-run -- .397's exp4299 BLOCKED by the aggregation bug) -- reconcile the verifier registry + gaps to .398 truth, run the GAP-4 regression guard, and LOG missing-verifier gaps. Record the .398 outcomes: the efficiency-parity verdict (exp4303 efficiency_pareto_holds + cost_ratio), the in-generation moat with engaged controls (exp4304 diffusiongemma_guidance_moat + controls_differentiated + scorer_leak_recheck_passed), the cross-DOMAIN selection verdict (exp4305 cross_domain_selection_holds + label_ablation_robust), the powered self-learning (exp4306 online_adaptation_helps), the ARC +1 (exp4307 total_levels). Update ops/verifier_registry.yaml + ops/verifier_gaps.md (per Missing-Verifier Gap Logging: e.g. a 'leak-free partial-state diffusion scorer' gap if exp4304's leak re-check failed; a 'cross-domain family-invariant selection' gap if exp4305 collapsed). Run the GAP-4 execution regression guard (no regression vs .397). Use the robust aggregate-available helper from exp4308 (read available artifacts, report gaps -- do NOT hard-block all-False if one is missing). Emit regression_guard_passed BARE bool. (⚠️ Research Finding) — honest_verdict=complete: registry_gaps_manifest_reconciled_to_v398_truth_regression_guard_passed_True_gaps_logged_1_robust_aggregator_used; results/experiment_4310_verifier_registry_gaps_hygiene.json
+- 2026-06-17: PHASE F3 (hardware continuity; opportunistic per north-star §3) -- KV260 terminal/opportunistic (SSH-only reachability + xmutil listapps; NO host SD-card precondition), PolarFire CPU dispatch hash-verify, GateMate USB detect. KV260 is terminal (north-star §3) so the per-board mandate relaxes to opportunistic; this task keeps the boards visible without blocking the milestone. Report per-board reachability + any opportunistic result. NO board blocks the milestone (honest blocked_<board> per board is fine). (⚠️ Blocked) — honest_verdict=complete: hardware_continuity_4311_kv260_kv260_terminal_xmutil_listapps_blocked_returncode_1_polarfire_polarfire_hash_verified_cpu_dispatch_succeeded_gatemate_blocked_gatemate_unreachable_ssh_usb_reachability_only; results/experiment_4311_hardware_continuity.json
